1
00:00:00,620 --> 00:00:05,136
Attention, staff. Gravity is
temporarily... optional.

2
00:00:05,176 --> 00:00:07,709
Rae! Everything's floating!

3
00:00:07,749 --> 00:00:10,018
Staff boots are magnetic.

4
00:00:10,058 --> 00:00:12,234
Mine are on backwards!

5
00:00:13,204 --> 00:00:14,570
Pip?

6
00:00:15,340 --> 00:00:17,766
Hi! I'm mopping the ceiling!

7
00:00:17,806 --> 00:00:20,217
The ceiling is the floor now.

8
00:00:20,687 --> 00:00:24,968
Great news! Floating items
are now half price.

9
00:00:25,008 --> 00:00:26,835
We don't do sales.

10
00:00:26,875 --> 00:00:28,563
We do now.

11
00:00:28,603 --> 00:00:30,424
How do I get down?

12
00:00:30,464 --> 00:00:31,830
Wait.

13
00:00:32,200 --> 00:00:36,126
Gravity restored in three... two...

14
00:00:36,896 --> 00:00:38,105
One.
